        "ConcurrentHashMap.containsKey(null) the moment the module first",
        "reached one of them. Verified: this silently discarded the",
        "in-progress generatePerson() call (and with it the ConditionOnset",
        "already recorded a few states earlier), which is why the pre-fix",
        "module's already-rare onsets never reliably reached conditions.csv."
      ],
      "symptom": "Jaundice",
      "codes": [
